      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but it feels like the \"critics\" side is just a bunch of people being afraid of change or trying to protect their own interests. don't you think the argument about \"diverting funds\" is kind of a weak excuse compared to the actual benefit of giving a kid a better school?",
